-- NorthstarIQ — Controlled lifecycle validation fixtures: provenance and disposition
--
-- ⚠️ LATER-CREATED REPRODUCIBILITY EVIDENCE — written 2026-09-01 AFTER the
-- controlled lifecycle validation had already been executed. This query was NOT
-- used during that validation and is not historical evidence of anything. It
-- exists so the fixture set can be identified and re-inspected on demand.
--
-- Purpose: make the four controlled fixtures impossible to misread later.
--
-- These are CONTROLLED VALIDATION FIXTURES created on 2026-09-01. They are NOT
-- part of the Synthetic Baseline, NOT historical records, and NOT customer-like
-- defects. Three of them were deliberately damaged after being legitimately
-- progressed, to exercise detective-control failure paths that the preventive
-- safeguard correctly prevents from arising on its own.
--
--   NIQ Fixture 01  Governed Full Lifecycle       progressed Open → Working → MQL
--                                                 → SAL → SQL, then natively
--                                                 converted. Retained.
--   NIQ Fixture 02  MQL Input Drift               legitimately qualified at MQL,
--                                                 then company size corrected so
--                                                 the segment became MQL-ineligible.
--   NIQ Fixture 03  Acceptance Evidence Removed   legitimately progressed to SAL,
--                                                 then MQL_Basis__c cleared.
--   NIQ Fixture 04  MQL Claimed at Creation       created directly at MQL; the
--                                                 create path runs no lifecycle gate.
--
-- Every basis string below was written by Lead_Inbound_Before_Save. None was
-- authored by hand. FX-02's basis still names the segment that qualified it,
-- which is the drift; FX-03's is null, which is the removal; FX-04 never had one.
--
-- Read-only. Safe to run against any org.

SELECT Id,
       Name,
       Company,
       Status,
       LeadSource,
       NumberOfEmployees,
       Segment__c,
       Segment_Basis__c,
       Territory__c,
       Match_Status__c,
       Lifecycle_Stage_Entered__c,
       MQL_Basis__c,
       Sales_Accepted__c,
       Sales_Accepted_At__c,
       Sales_Acceptance_Basis__c,
       Qualified_Need__c,
       Next_Step_Date__c,
       SQL_Basis__c,
       IsConverted,
       ConvertedDate,
       ConvertedAccountId,
       ConvertedContactId,
       ConvertedOpportunityId,
       CreatedDate
FROM Lead
WHERE Company LIKE 'NIQ Fixture%'
ORDER BY Company
